'''Garbodor''' (Japanese: '''ダストダス''' ''Dustdas'') is a {{ct|Darkness}} Stage 1 Pokémon card in [[Pokémon Trading Card Game Pocket]]. It is part of the {{TCGP|Celestial Guardians}} expansion.

