==Trivia==
===Origin===
*This card's illustration was first featured on {{TCG ID|Noble Victories|Garbodor|49}} from the {{TCG|Noble Victories}} expansion.
*'''Super Poison Breath''' is an attack that first appeared on {{TCG ID|EX Sandstorm|Breloom|33}} from the {{TCG|EX Sandstorm}} expansion.
*This card's [[Pokédex]] entry comes from {{g|Sword}}.

